  m_text: 'COUNT TO ZERO / ASSET CREDITS


    Pixel UI Sci-Fi Free - HUD Kit Sampler 1.0.4

    heyheythere / HeyHeyThere

    https://itch.io/profile/heyheythere

    Unity Asset Store product 412096


    Joystick Pack 2.1

    Fenerax Studios

    https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/input-management/joystick-pack-107631


    GravityBold8: JohnWatson

    ZF #2ndPixelus: Chayanon Ruamcharoen (2005)

    2005_iannnnnAMD: Prachya Singhto / iannnnn (2005)

    Font metadata on the latter two states: For educations used only.

    Liberation Sans: Steve Matteson / Ascender; Google (2010), Red Hat (2012). SIL OFL 1.1.


    Character source sheets (man/1, man/8 and supplied variants): supplied with this project; original creator not identified in local metadata.

    Hero, robot and assistant edits: project Aseprite artwork.

    Comic cutscenes 1-3: original project artwork, drawn in Aseprite.


    Choose, wobble, Explosion, GameOver, Hit, Lucky, Pickup audio: supplied with this project; original creator not identified in local metadata.

    Polish audio / music beds: project synthesis, Tools/generate_polish_audio.py.

    Arena geometry, circuit borders, particles and pattern assets: project-generated.


    Unity / TextMesh Pro / Universal Render Pipeline / Input System: Unity Technologies and package contributors.

    Aseprite: Igara Studio (art authoring tool).


    Detailed local asset inventory: Documentation/asset-credit-inventory.csv

    Unidentified source credits remain explicitly marked; no authorship inferred.


    Mobile control icons: gdb-switch-2.png, supplied with the project; creator not identified in accompanying metadata. Sprite sheet preserved; four slices used for orange fire, white slide/focus and analog.


    Blocked boss-hit cue: original project synthesis, Tools/generate_blocked_audio.py (no external samples).

'
